commit a92f3c847f445800e631a43bc2ab5894fedbc841
Author: Cherma Rajan A <cherma.rajan@ittiam.com>
Date:   Thu Feb 17 20:14:47 2022 +0530

    Avoid abs_sum_level computation conditionally

    abs_sum_level is needed to decide the job scheduling order of
    pack bitstream multi-threading. The computation can be avoided
    when MT is disabled or multiple tiles are not used. This change
    could avoid additional overhead due to computation of
    abs_sum_level.

    Speed data for RT preset.
         Instruction Count
    cpu    Reduction(%)
     7       0.189
     8       0.236
     9       0.434
    10       0.474

    Change-Id: Id83f97b023f6e5275d1bfd59b889bcfb99dee067
